#N canvas 120 60 820 560 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_hit <name> <label> <freq> - percussive hit on each gesture/<label> trigger from the Pi's recognizer. Loudness = match confidence. Noise through a resonant bandpass that sweeps from 4x freq down to freq in 150 ms \; 300 ms decay. Give each label its own freq., f 100;
#X obj 20 100 fs_in \$1 gesture/\$2;
#X obj 20 130 t f b;
#X msg 300 170 4 \, 1 150;
#X obj 300 200 vline~;
#X obj 300 230 *~ \$3;
#X msg 20 170 \$1 1 \, 0 300 1;
#X obj 20 200 vline~;
#X obj 20 230 *~;
#X obj 120 260 noise~;
#X obj 20 300 *~;
#X obj 20 340 vcf~ 6;
#X obj 20 380 *~ 2;
#X obj 20 420 outlet~;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 1 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 11 1;
#X connect 2 0 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
#X connect 7 0 8 0;
#X connect 7 0 8 1;
#X connect 9 0 10 0;
#X connect 8 0 10 1;
#X connect 10 0 11 0;
#X connect 11 0 12 0;
#X connect 12 0 13 0;
